      "text": "Zero",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S7Eih",
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><mi> </mi><mi>μ</mi><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we know that the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;at any point t gives as current at that point</p><p>and in this case the curve is constant&nbsp;&nbsp;at the point of 4 so that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is zero</p><p>Since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced open=\"\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Therefore current <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
